13. SYSTEM ROLE OF COMMAND ENGINE

The Command Engine Layer functions as:

execution orchestration backbone of CommandCenter
structured intent interpreter for all system actions
governance-enforced routing layer for all operations
bridge between intelligence and execution layers

It does NOT execute actions directly.

It defines how commands become governed, traceable execution pathways across the system graph.

